<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>sattyre-registry<sp/>examples</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Serve<sp/>packages<sp/>locally.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Publish<sp/>archives<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>registry.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Fetch<sp/>packages<sp/>by<sp/>name.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">List<sp/>available<sp/>packages.</highlight></codeline>
